OL,3,GNEWSARyan Reynolds invites fan for
OL,4,Aphoto on Isle Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fan of Hollywood A-lister Ryan
OL,7,FReynolds said she was "starstruck" when
OL,8,Fthe actor invited her to take a photo
OL,9,Fwith him on Douglas promenade on
OL,10,FThursday.
OL,12,FReynolds is known for the Deadpool
OL,13,Ffranchise and the Welcome to Wrexham
OL,14,Fdocumentary series.
OL,16,FVinus Arevalo has lived on the island
OL,17,Ffor more than four years and said it
OL,18,Fwas unexpected to see her "idol"
OL,19,Foutside her workplace on a normal
OL,20,FThursday morning.
