OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 33-year-old said she was looking
OL,7,Fout the window to see "more clearly" if
OL,8,Fit was really him, when he called over
OL,9,Fand invited her for a photo. She
OL,10,Fdescribed it as "an amazing
OL,11,Fexperience".
